{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20267J9lbyrKAF1795661182.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>網上流傳一段驚險影片，拍下一名操菲律賓語的女子在飛鵝山自殺崖徒手攀崖打卡的驚險過程，遭大批網民怒轟「玩命」。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-26-10h30m08s897.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026A5vGXk07kR1795661143.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>涉事影片畫面上印有一句菲律賓文字「sabi nga ni Ate hindi naman NAKAKATAKOT pero NAKAKAMATAY lang」，大意是指「姐姐都說了，其實並不可怕，只是會致命而已」。根據片段顯示，該名女子當時在疑似同鄉的協助下攀落山，同行友人則在旁為她打氣，並以菲律賓語鼓勵說「一點都不可怕，你可以的」；然而去到片尾時，當該女子就快去到盡頭，友人亦不禁開口制止：「不要再走到盡頭了！就停在那裏吧。」影片隨即結束。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-26-10h30m24s774.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026TyxzPpQfBP1795661152.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>片段在網上流傳後隨即掀起熱烈討論，一眾網民對罔顧安全的行為深感憤怒，紛紛留言怒轟：「攞條命嚟玩害人害己」、「不顧安全及不負責任」、「唔好累救援人員」，亦有人痛批：「係悶到無嘢好玩？定係覺得自己條命唔值錢？」及「打卡重要過條命？」。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T04:00:05.412875+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":393,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T02:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T05:34:41.776696+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T03:53:28.955939+00:00","content_hash":"0b74dad82c4207a6a023337dbec77d8398dc74414b51fc65ddd042baecbb907a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T04:00:05.412875+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}